      "ordinal": 166,
      "text": "直接可以",
      "start": 521520,
      "end": 522419
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 167,
      "text": "我不想直辖这个团体啊",
      "start": 522419,
      "end": 525820
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 168,
      "text": "我会找个人吧",
      "start": 525820,
      "end": 527280
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 169,
      "text": "那么我我要说的就是说",
      "start": 529440,
      "end": 532579
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 170,
      "text": "这个还有啊是生活方式上",
      "start": 535020,
      "end": 537560
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 171,
      "text": "除了这个吃啊",
      "start": 537560,
      "end": 538640
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 172,
      "text": "营养均衡啊",
